      "content": "so basically you're saying it's an unbalanced trade-off. if the trend is clearly toward centralization and hurting smaller states, does that mean the whole idea of \"international cooperation\" is just a facade? like, is it even possible for these organizations to be anything other than tools for larger powers to enforce their own rules?",
